---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Early-stage terms for the current read-only pfseeker development site."
>
  <section class="page-shell prose-page" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
      <h1 id="terms-title">Early-stage terms</h1>
      <p>
        These terms describe the current development-stage site and are not
        final production moderation or publication terms.
      </p>
    </div>
    <section aria-labelledby="terms-current">
      <h2 id="terms-current">Current use</h2>
      <p>
        pfseeker currently publishes informational routes and development-stage
        surfaces. Public browsing is available without an account. Private
        synced collections and image submissions require Discord sign-in. Phase
        13 moderation is implemented on a feature branch. Public reports are not
        active.
      </p>
      <p>
        Collection access and management are authenticated-only production
        behavior. Public collection publishing remains deferred.
      </p>
      <p>
        Submitted images enter a private pending state and may never be
        published. Category, existing tags, suggested tags, source URL, and
        creator credit fields are optional at intake. Moderators may assign or
        correct taxonomy before publication. Users must not submit images
        containing obvious nudity, gore or graphic injury, or hateful imagery.
        Cancelling a pending submission deletes the pending submission and
        uploaded pending file.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="terms-future">
      <h2 id="terms-future">Before launch</h2>
      <p>
        Final production terms should be reviewed before creator profiles,
        public collection publishing, reports, or broader public submission
        publishing become available.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
